
@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<style>
    .privacy-container {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        padding: 40px;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 12px;

    }

    .privacy-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        padding-bottom: 25px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #e9ecef;
    }

    .privacy-header h1 {
        color: #242b40;
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .privacy-header p {
        color: #6c757d;
    }

    .privacy-section {
        margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .privacy-section h2 {
        color: #253858;
        font-size: 23px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .privacy-section p,
    .privacy-section li {
        color: #495057;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .privacy-section ul {
        padding-left: 25px;
    }

    .privacy-section li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .privacy-highlight {
        background: #f1f5ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #4361ee;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .privacy-footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding-top: 25px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        color: #6c757d;
    }

    @@media (max-width: 768px) {
        .privacy-container {
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 10px;
        }

        .privacy-header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
        }
    }
</style>

<div class="container">
    <div class="privacy-container">

        <div class="privacy-header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>
                Your privacy matters to us at GameHub.
            </p>
            <small>
                Last Updated: October 12, 2026
            </small>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-highlight">
            <strong>Welcome to GameHub!</strong>
            <p class="mb-0">
                At GameHub, we are committed to protecting
                your personal information and providing a
                safe, enjoyable gaming experience.
                This Privacy Policy explains how we collect,
                use, store, and protect your information.
            </p>
        </div>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                GameHub is an online gaming platform designed
                to provide users with access to gaming content,
                interactive features, and entertainment services.
            </p>
            <p>
                By accessing or using our website, you
                acknowledge that you have read this Privacy
                Policy. We encourage you to review it carefully
                to understand how your information is handled.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                Depending on the features you use, GameHub
                may collect the following information:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Personal Information:</strong>
                    Name, username, email address, and
                    account registration information.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Gaming Information:</strong>
                    Games played, scores, achievements,
                    preferences, and gaming activity.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Device Information:</strong>
                    Browser type, operating system,
                    IP address, and device information.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Usage Information:</strong>
                    Pages visited, session duration,
                    and interactions with our services.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Cookies:</strong>
                    Information collected through cookies
                    and similar technologies.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

            <p>
                We may use collected information to:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Provide and maintain GameHub services.</li>
                <li>Improve website performance and functionality.</li>
                <li>Personalize gaming experiences.</li>
                <li>Manage user accounts and profiles.</li>
                <li>Provide technical support.</li>
                <li>Prevent fraud and unauthorized access.</li>
                <li>Analyze website traffic and usage trends.</li>
                <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub may use cookies to improve your
                browsing experience and remember your
                preferences.
            </p>

            <p>
                Cookies may help us maintain login sessions,
                understand website traffic, and improve
                gaming functionality.
            </p>

            <p>
                You can manage cookies through your browser
                settings. Disabling certain cookies may
                affect some website features.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>5. Data Security</h2>

            <p>
                Protecting user information is important
                to GameHub.
            </p>

            <p>
                We use reasonable technical and organizational
                security measures designed to protect
                information against unauthorized access,
                disclosure, alteration, and destruction.
            </p>

            <p>
                However, no internet-based service can
                guarantee complete security.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>6. Sharing Your Information</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub may share limited information
                with trusted service providers that
                support website hosting, analytics,
                payment processing, or security.
            </p>

            <p>
                We may also disclose information when
                required by applicable law or necessary
                to protect our users and services.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub may contain links to third-party
                gaming websites, advertisements,
                and external services.
            </p>

            <p>
                These websites operate independently
                and may have their own privacy policies.
                We encourage users to review those
                policies before providing information.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub is committed to protecting
                children's personal information.
            </p>

            <p>
                Our services are not intended for children
                under the age of 13 unless appropriate
                parental consent and legal safeguards
                are in place.
            </p>

            <p>
                If we discover that personal information
                has been collected from a child in
                violation of applicable law, we will
                take appropriate steps to remove it.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>9. Your Privacy Rights</h2>

            <p>
                Depending on applicable laws, users
                may have the right to:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Request access to their personal data.</li>
                <li>Correct inaccurate information.</li>
                <li>Request deletion of eligible personal data.</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent where applicable.</li>
                <li>Manage communication preferences.</li>
                <li>Request information about data processing.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>10. Data Retention</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub retains personal information
                only for as long as reasonably necessary
                to provide services, fulfill legitimate
                business purposes, and meet legal obligations.
            </p>

            <p>
                Information that is no longer required
                may be deleted or anonymized.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy
                periodically to reflect changes in
                our services, technology, or legal
                requirements.
            </p>

            <p>
                Updates will be published on this page
                with a revised date.
            </p>
        </section>

      

        <div class="privacy-footer">
            <p>
                &copy; @DateTime.Now.Year GameHub.
                All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
            <p>
                Thank you for being part of the
                GameHub community.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>